--- meta
title: Your [PRODUCT_NAME] payment failed
aria: Your [PRODUCT_NAME] payment failed
preheader: Most often this is an expired card. Your service is not affected for now.
subject: Your [PRODUCT_NAME] payment failed
footer: transactional
reason: You are receiving this email because a payment for the [PRODUCT_NAME] subscription on the account registered to [EMAIL_ADDRESS] did not go through.
