--- text
Your payment did not go through

The charge for your [PRODUCT_NAME] subscription did not go through.
In most cases the card on file has expired or been replaced, and
nothing is wrong on your side.

Details of the payment

Amount: [CURRENCY] [AMOUNT]
Plan: [PLAN_NAME]
Payment method: [CARD_BRAND] ending [CARD_LAST4]
Next attempt: [RETRY_DATE]

Update payment method:

[CTA_URL]

Your service is not affected for now. The charge will be retried
automatically on [RETRY_DATE]. If you update the card before then,
the next attempt will use it.

If the card on file is correct, your bank can tell you why the
charge was refused. To ask us, reply to this email, or write to
[SUPPORT_EMAIL]. A real person reads every message.

[SIGNOFF_NAME], [COMPANY_NAME]
